    "title": "Chyrpe Dating: Match & Love",
    "description": "CHYRPE, WHERE POWERFUL WOMEN DATE\r\n\r\nChyrpe is the dating app for powerful women and those who love them. Take control over your dating life and connect with people who are looking to show you the genuine appreciation you deserve. Chyrpe is the dating app where patriarchal values and misogyny have absolutely no place. Find your match in a community with female satisfaction at its core, discovering the beauty of female-led relationships. \r\n\r\nHOW WOMEN ARE EMPOWERED ON CHYRPE\r\n\r\nToo much in online dating is still fundamentally built around male pleasure and a male view of the world. Chyrpe\u2019s mission is to put women first in the online dating experience.\r\n\r\n- Using the power board, you decide about the conversations you have with different people.\r\n- Using our profile feedback function, tell men how to create profiles that match your expectations\r\n- Count on the highest level of security with mandatory verification for all users accessing chyrpe\r\n\r\nUsers who want to see who likes them or give more likes can upgrade to chyrpe Gold. Further features are available on chyrpe Evolved.\r\n\r\nTo ensure a balanced community in all regards, we employ a fair waiting list. Proceeds generated from select speed-ups available are used in their totality for speeding the waiting up for all users.\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIPTION INFO\r\n\r\nYour payment method will be charged once your purchase has been completed and confirmed.\r\nAny subscription renews automatically. You can change this up to 24 hours prior to the end of the current subscription period in your Play Store settings. If you do not change anything, your account will be charged within the 24 hour window prior to the end of each period.\r\n\r\nSupport: support@chyrpe.com\r\nTerms of Service: https://www.chyrpe.com/legal/terms-of-use\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.chyrpe.com/legal/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nAll photos are of models and used for illustrative purposes only.",
